{"lyrics":"[00:00.00] [Instrumental Intro]\n[Intro: Juice WRLD & Future]\n[00:19.36] (Wheezy outta here)\n[00:19.96] Yeah, uh\n[Chorus]\n[00:20.34] If Wheezy outta here, we outta here\n[00:21.34] Private jet lag, we flew here\n[00:22.08] Kel-Tec and TEC, niggas kill here\n[00:23.40] Hi-Tech attack, pourin' red, yeah\n[00:24.88] I ain't never lack, at all, yeah, I'ma keep the steel here\n[00:27.94] Nowadays I'm never in the mall, yeah, just hit the Saks Fifth\n[00:31.00] Lace up the Raf Simons, uh, ball 'til I fall, yeah\n[00:34.18] Balmain and Vetements, yeah, ball 'til I fall, yeah\n[00:37.16] Saint Laurent Premadonna, I got it all, yeah\n[00:40.36] Codeine with the marijuana, oh, oh\n[Verse 1]\n[00:41.84] Yeah, let's get it, get it, yeah\n[00:47.52] Uh, please get me some racks, okay\n[00:49.28] I don't need your racks, okay?\n[00:50.70] Gun on my hip when I walk to the bank\n[00:52.14] If I'm broke, hit a lick, I need what's in your safe\n[00:53.58] My right wrist be a Lambo', the left is a Wraith\n[00:55.22] December 2nd, that's my birthday\n[00:56.78] I remind her that, because I'm getting the cake\n[00:58.24] If that nigga trippin' we gon' put him away\n[01:00.04] You can call me Suge (Okay)\n[01:01.50] I pray to God I'll have fun today\n[01:02.92] 'Cause these niggas tryna steal my wave (Uh)\n[01:05.04] They gon' end up drowning, fuck it\n[01:06.54] Soul money, I can't count it, run it\n[Bridge]\n[01:08.24] It's just me and Wheezy, makin' shit look easy (Uh)\n[01:11.20] Burnin' them trees, sippin' that lean, gettin' the green\n[01:13.54] Nothing come in between, fuck you mean?\n[01:15.88] I'm Freddy Krueger in your dream\n[01:18.56] Wake up, MAC tear his face up (Uh)\n[Verse 2]\n[01:20.88] Shoot it like a Laker, nigga better pay up\n[01:24.00] Me and his bitch lay up, all night and day, yuh\n[01:27.04] Stripes on her, no zebra (Let's go)\n[01:28.66] That bitch, she from Mexico, I call her my Amiga (Uh-huh)\n[01:31.80] Everything was cool until I found out she