2] Oh, goin' to the opp block, are you slidin' with me?\n[03:24.42] Made a lot of them bitches envy, we ain't showin' no mercy\n[03:27.06] Run up and bust down semis, give them niggas plimsy\n[03:29.38] Can't fuck with me, oh (Oh)\n[03:31.78] We got way too many semis (Grah)\n[03:34.62] Do 'em dirty, call me Suge today\n[03:36.16] Take the Perc' to the face, I don't fuck with the cane\n[03:37.92] I had your girl sendin' the pace\n[03:40.30] Uh, thot bitch, I'm still hittin' it\n[03:42.80] Like a broke copy machine, you don't get paper\n[03:45.54] Ain't no IOU, I don't do no favors\n[Chorus]\n[03:49.08] If Wheezy outta here, we outta here\n[03:50.70] Private jet lag, we flew here\n[03:52.28] Kel-Tec and TEC, niggas kill here\n[03:53.88] Hi-Tech attack, pourin' red, yeah\n[03:55.38] I ain't never lack, at all, yeah, I'ma keep the steel here\n[03:58.48] Nowadays I'm never in the mall, yeah, just hit the Saks Fifth\n[04:01.58] Lace up the Raf Simons, uh, ball 'til I fall, yeah\n[04:04.74] Balmain and Vetements, yeah, ball 'til I fall, yeah\n[04:07.74] Saint Laurent Premadonna, I got it all, yeah\n[04:10.86] Codeine with the marijuana, oh, oh","words":[[0.0,4.86,"[00:00.00]"],[6.34,18.46,"[Instrumental"],[18.5,18.62,"Intro]"],[18.66,18.76,"[Intro:"],[18.8,18.92,"Juice"],[18.96,19.08,"WRLD"],[19.1,19.12,"&"],[19.16,19.28,"Future]"],[19.3,19.32,"[00:18.70]"],[19.36,19.5,"(Wheezy"],[19.54,19.68,"outta"],[19.76,19.88,"here)"],[19.9,19.92,"[00:19.20]"],[19.96,20.02,"Yeah,"],[20.06,20.1,"uh"],[20.14,20.24,"[Chorus]"],[20.26,20.28,"[00:19.54]"],[20.34,20.36,"If"],[20.42,20.58,"Wheezy"],[20.62,20.74,"outta"],[20.8,20.88,"here,"],[20.92,20.94,"we"],[20.98,21.08,"outta"],[21.14,21.26,"here"],[21.28,21.3,"[00:20.42]"],[21.34,21.48,"Private"],[21.56,21.6,"jet"],[21.64,21.68,"lag,"],[21.72,21.74,"we"],[21.78,21.84,"flew"],[21.88,22.0,"here"],[22.02,22.04,"[00:21.70]"],[22.08,22.24,"Kel-Tec"],[22.28,22.32,"and"],[22.38,22.42,"TEC,"],[22.46,22.68,"niggas"],[22.74,22.94,"kill"],[23.02,2